WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.630
House of the Dragon starts filming in a few
days and airs next year. This Game of Thrones

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:10.120
prequel show will tell the story of the Dance
of the Dragons, a Targaryen civil war that

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:16.340
took place over 100 years before Game of Thrones.
In January, HBO announced they are developing

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:21.380
a show based on George R.R. Martin’s Tales
of Dunk and Egg series, which follows the

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:27.380
legendary knight Ser Dunk the Tall and his
squire, the Targaryen prince, Egg. This series

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:38.960
is set 90 years before Game of Thrones.
Raised as Dunk in Flea Bottom, Duncan became

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:44.450
a squire of the hedge knight Arlan of Pennytree.
Duncan then traveled the Seven Kingdoms as

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:50.350
a hedge knight himself, with the young Prince
Aegon Targaryen, called "Egg", as his squire.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:55.149
The early exploits of "Dunk and Egg" are chronicled
in A Knight of the Seven Kingdoms, which collects

00:00:55.149 --> 00:00:59.059
The Hedge Knight, The Sworn Sword, and The
Mystery Knight.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:03.290
Ser Duncan the Tall was a great knight in
the history of Westeros that served loyaly

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:09.080
to House Targaryen. He was a famous warrior
and a great friend and champion to King Aegon

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:15.210
V Targaryen. He's immortalized in many songs
and stories. The pair of "Dunk and Egg" had

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:20.780
many famous adventures. This included a visit
to Dorne, where they were nearly killed by

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:26.790
the apparently insane Lady of Vaith, as well
as resolving a decades-long dispute between

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:31.970
the houses Osgrey and Webber in the Reach.
They also helped foil the Second Blackfyre

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:38.500
Rebellion before undertaking a lengthy journey
north to visit Winterfell. Many years later

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:44.130
Egg ascended the Iron Throne as King Aegon
V Targaryen. Ser Duncan the Tall became a

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:49.740
member of the Kingsguard, and later its Lord
Commander. Duncan was one of the heroes of

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:55.920
the Fourth Blackfyre Rebellion. Egg and Dunk
faced their last adventure together at Summerhall,

00:01:55.920 --> 00:02:00.500
on the night of the great fire which killed
them, the same night Rhaegar Targaryen was

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:07.200
born there. HBO is also working on a show
about Robert’s Rebellion which ended a 300

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:13.630
years old Targaryen dynasty in Westeors, and
almost ended Targaryens themselves. To everyone

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:18.920
who watched Game of Thrones, Robert’s Rebellion
is quite known. Robert, Ned Stark and Jon

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:25.980
Arryn rebelled against the Mad King and overthrew
Targaryens. It lasted "close to a year" and

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:30.560
resulted in the end of the Targaryen dynasty
in the Seven Kingdoms and the beginning of

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:36.060
Robert Baratheon's reign. It had 10 major
battles and ultimately resulted with the victory

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:42.190
for the rebels, the end of the Targaryen dynasty,
and the start of the Baratheon dynasty. This

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:47.600
show will bring many characters we know and
love back on the screens. Ned Stark, Robert

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:53.599
Baratheon, Tywin Lannister, Rhaegar Targaryen
and Lyanna Stark, the Mad King etc. And if

00:02:53.599 --> 00:02:58.769
you thought this was good enough news, well
there’s more. As many as 3 more new Game

00:02:58.769 --> 00:03:03.570
of Thrones prequels have been announced to
be in work, or rather in a developing stage

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:10.780
in HBO. First of the 3 new prequels is called:
10,000 ships. 10,000 Ships is a reference

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:17.090
to the journey made by warrior queen Princess
Nymeria and the surviving members of the Rhoynars,

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:22.040
who travelled from Essos to Dorne following
their defeat by the Valyrian Freehold in the

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:28.660
Second Spice War. She lost, but rather to
submit to their rule, she led her people across

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:33.209
the Narrow Sea and settled in Dorne, which
her descendants would rule for generations

00:03:33.209 --> 00:03:39.840
to come. She and her people came to this new
land in 10,000 ships, which Nymeria burned,

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:44.450
preventing any of her men from wanting to
go home or somewhere else and giving a clear

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:50.830
sign that this strange Dornish land is their
new home. While legends often claim that Nymeria

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:57.319
commanded a fleet of ten thousand ships, Beldecar,
the inside of A Song of Ice and Fire author

00:03:57.319 --> 00:04:02.659
of the History of the Rhoynish Wars whose
copy can be found in the Red Keep's library

00:04:02.659 --> 00:04:08.769
argues that the number was inflated, perhaps
by tenfold. While other chroniclers offer

00:04:08.769 --> 00:04:11.739
other numbers, in truth no count was ever
made.

00:04:11.739 --> 00:04:18.279
Maester Yandel agrees that Nymeria led a great
many ships, mostly river craft, skiffs, poleboats,

00:04:18.279 --> 00:04:23.800
trading galleys, fishing boats, rafts, and
pleasure barges, crammed with women, children,

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:29.490
and old men. Beldecar insists only one in
ten was seaworthy`. At the time of Nymeria's

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:34.900
arrival, Dorne was a poor land where a score
of lords and petty kings quarreled over rivers,

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:40.819
wells, and fertile water. Many viewed the
Rhoynar as unwelcome invaders who should be

00:04:40.819 --> 00:04:46.199
driven back into the sea. However, Lord Mors
Martell of the Sandship saw an opportunity

00:04:46.199 --> 00:04:51.759
in the Rhoynar—and singers claim that Lord
Martell also lost his heart to a beautiful

00:04:51.759 --> 00:04:58.449
princess. With many trained in warfare, the
Rhoynar added their strength to Lord Martell's

00:04:58.449 --> 00:05:04.569
own, increasing his host by tenfold. Mors
married Nymeria, and hundreds of his knights,

00:05:04.569 --> 00:05:10.379
squires, and bannermen wed Rhoynish women,
uniting the two people by blood. The Rhoynar

00:05:10.379 --> 00:05:16.039
also brought considerable wealth with them
and their artisans and armorers' skills were

00:05:16.039 --> 00:05:21.680
far advanced than those of their Westerosi
counterparts. To celebrate these unions and

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:27.729
to ensure that her people could not retreat
to the sea again, Nymeria burned her fleet,

00:05:27.729 --> 00:05:32.809
declaring her wanderings to be at an end,
although some of her people mourned the loss

00:05:32.809 --> 00:05:38.990
of their ships. Nymeria named her husband
the Prince of Dorne, declaring his dominion

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:45.800
over all of Dorne. However, such supremacy
was not an easy feat and years of war followed,

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:52.059
called Nymeria's War. The Rhoynar and the
Martells subdued one petty king after another,

00:05:52.059 --> 00:05:57.120
and no fewer than six kings were sent to the
Wall to join the Night's Watch by Nymeria

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:03.319
and her husband. Soon, only King Yorick V
Yronwood remained, the greatest of the Dornish

00:06:03.319 --> 00:06:09.259
kings. Nymeria and the Martells battled against
Yronwood and his bannermen for nine years.

00:06:09.259 --> 00:06:14.969
When her husband fell to Yronwood's sword
in the Third Battle of the Boneway, Nymeria

00:06:14.969 --> 00:06:20.970
assumed sole command of the Martell armies.
Two more years of battle followed, but Nymeria

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:28.130
eventually defeated Yorick V and he bent the
knee to her, ensuring Martell supremacy. Thereafter

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:34.380
Nymeria ruled from Sunspear, the new seat
of House Martell built around Sandship. This

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:40.229
migration took place around 1,000 years before
the events depicted in A Song of Ice and Fire

00:06:40.229 --> 00:06:47.029
novels. Arya Stark named her direwolf after
Nymeria. The second new prequel is named:

00:06:47.029 --> 00:06:52.960
Flea Bottom. Flea Bottom is the poorest slum
district in King’s Landing, a maze-like

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:58.719
warren of narrow streets and dark alleys filled
with tanneries and ale houses. It’s featured

00:06:58.719 --> 00:07:04.860
many times in Game of Thrones, including when
Arya Stark takes refuge there after fleeing

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:10.849
the Red Keep. Characters from Flea Bottom
include Ser Davos Seaworth, Gendry and Karl

00:07:10.849 --> 00:07:16.089
Tanner, a brother of the Night’s Watch.
The famous hedge knight, Ser Duncan the Tall

00:07:16.089 --> 00:07:23.259
is also from Flea Bottom. The third and final
new Game of Thrones prequel is called: 9 Voyages.

00:07:23.259 --> 00:07:29.490
9 Voyages refers to the great voyages at sea
made by Corlys Velaryon known as Sea Snake

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:36.050
aboard the Sea Snake ship. By the of age seven-and-thirty,
Corlys was hailed as the greatest seafarer

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:42.159
the Seven Kingdoms had ever known. Corlys
was said to be as brilliant as he was restless,

00:07:42.159 --> 00:07:48.449
and as adventurous as he was ambitious. Corlys
Velaryon, known as the Sea Snake, was a fabled

00:07:48.449 --> 00:07:54.099
Lord of the Tides, Master of Driftmark, and
head of House Velaryon. He was the husband

00:07:54.099 --> 00:07:59.949
of Princess Rhaenys Targaryen. During the
Dance of the Dragons, he became Hand to Queen

00:07:59.949 --> 00:08:05.770
Rhaenyra Targaryen. Lord Velaryon journeyed
to places including Pentos, Dragonstone and

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:11.869
around the bottom of Westeros as well as to
Lys, Tyrosh and Myr. He reached the fabled

00:08:11.869 --> 00:08:17.669
lands of Yi Ti and Leng, whose wealth doubled
that of the House Velaryon, and him and the

00:08:17.669 --> 00:08:23.110
Ice Wolf headed north searching for passage
around the top of Westeros, only to find frozen

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:29.789
seas and icebergs as big as mountains. The
show chronicles Corlys Velayrion’s adventures.

00:08:29.789 --> 00:08:34.361
Interestingly, lord Corlys will also play
a big role in House of the Dragon and this

00:08:34.361 --> 00:08:39.349
prequel will only get more interest by fans
when House of the Dragon airs and everyone

00:08:39.349 --> 00:08:45.100
falls in love with the Sea Snake character.
In conclusion, HBO is working on many Game

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:49.899
of Thrones prequel shows, and beside House
of the Dragons, none of these will air before

00:08:49.899 --> 00:08:55.190
2023 at earliest. But this is all good news
and don't worry about the release dates of

00:08:55.190 --> 00:09:01.750
these prequels. As confirmed by HBO's president,
House of the Dragon will air in 2022 which

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:05.930
is in just one year.
Miguel Sapochnik and Ryan Condal will serve

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:11.310
as showrunners and executive producers. George
R. R. Martin will also serve as executive

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:16.850
producer. It’s based on George RR Martin’s
book Fire And Blood volume 1 and on Martin’s

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:21.680
yet unfinished Fire And Blood volume 2 book.
The key event of the show is also the key

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:27.290
in the history of House Targaryen, the Dance
of the Dragons - the Targaryen civil war,

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:32.480
which divided the entire kingdom and launched
a huge war that was fought from 129 AC to

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:38.170
131 AC. The Dance of the Dragons was the most
devastating war in the history of the Seven

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:44.770
Kingdoms. The war of succession between Aegon
II and his half-sister Rhaenyra over their

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:50.870
father Viserys I's throne. Both of them thought
they belonged on the Iron Throne. When people

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:56.670
started declaring for one of them or the other,
their fight divided the kingdoms in two. Targaryens

00:09:56.670 --> 00:10:02.620
fought Targaryens, brothers fought brothers,
dragons fought dragons. By the time it was

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:08.459
over, thousands were dead. House of the Dragon
is coming with many Targaryens and their dragons

00:10:08.459 --> 00:10:13.660
as well as with other legendary characters
such as Sea Snake, Cregan Stark and his Winter

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:18.370
Wolfs, Red Kraken and many more.Thank you
so much for watching and please let me know

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:25.339
which prequel you're looking forward the most.

